r, RUI! She is a girl with short black hair and long eyelashes. She is stoic and doesn't show emotions easily, but still has a sense of cuteness and innocence.\n\nI would love if it could be a mixture of idol-like and your cute lolita style! If the overall theme could be a light blue color, that would be wonderful. Otherwise you can design freely as you wish! \n\nPlease feel free to appeal if the amount is not enough. Thank you for considering!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/19L2LHSvQy4xpv3PAgNjcfHQfljTcrzYu", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Noodle39510/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1a7c98e8/uploads/origins/c44a294f-c5de-4f72-b9a8-06a765d686d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8399de2ced7233ce8950e1b20a4adf56", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1a7c98e8/uploads/origins/c44a294f-c5de-4f72-b9a8-06a765d686d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8399de2ced7233ce8950e1b20a4adf56, https://si.imgix.net/1a7c98e8/uploads/origins/c44a294f-c5de-4f72-b9a8-06a765d686d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=13072f9804bdd6f30c6fef190e5dbec5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1a7c98e8/uploads/origins/c44a294f-c5de-4f72-b9a8-06a765d686d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=efc7694205c7c55b6df8091ee81689cc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。あなたの画風が大好きで、ぜひ依頼したいです。\nできればスイーツロリータのような感じで、デザートをテーマにしたいです。\nポーズ、スタイル、服装、描き方はあなた次第です。\n全ての情報は参考リンクにありますので、ご覧ください。SNSやYoutubeのサムネイル、商用利用も考えています。よろしくお願いします！\n(キャラクターは二重人格です。）\n幡津りんご(通常状態)/***幡津りんご(マスク状態)\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10V7rJ6VI-58Om3yewqQgfWmSQ6ZEjMzg?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Noodle39510/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/588450b0/uploads/origins/123b35ab-ae7e-402e-85a9-f332c3c4dd4b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=