y thumbnails / SNS if you're okay with that.\n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1X6ZjrP3ATHP3xqlY49M46te3fgl0BptR?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Noodle39510/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/081dadad/uploads/origins/da418062-717d-4052-8e0e-4f2d994ab40a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75c8fd07982a9a10bdbb6640e9e47102", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/081dadad/uploads/origins/da418062-717d-4052-8e0e-4f2d994ab40a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75c8fd07982a9a10bdbb6640e9e47102, https://si.imgix.net/081dadad/uploads/origins/da418062-717d-4052-8e0e-4f2d994ab40a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f89be4a66906df66a316374f30329abe 2x, https://si.imgix.net/081dadad/uploads/origins/da418062-717d-4052-8e0e-4f2d994ab40a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=17632b1bda63c00693585dc53d7b6c17 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "アピールしてくれてありがとうございます\n\n私のキャラを描いてくれたら嬉しいです。ペットのメロちゃんと一緒に描いてもいいかも...？\nもしよかったら、服装もロリっぽいものに変えてみてください\n\nどんな作品に仕上がるか楽しみです\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Y-wUQfd8Ew8fBeL1cyyJzPPT3jPljt5O?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Noodle39510/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5a301b43/uploads/origins/41009980-d23c-497b-8fac-57417ee78a95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ca80051361b4fe5583dc9537741b2982", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5a301b43/uploads/origins/41009980-d23c-497b-8fac-57417ee78a95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ca80051361b4fe5583dc9537741b2982, https://si.imgix.net/5a301b43/uploads/origins/41009980-d23c-497b-8fac-57417ee78a95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a547f59b548e62dcaf6f5a7e9743e206 2x, https://si.imgix.ne